%% webular — User journey: research a topic from a cold install.
journey
    title webular — research a topic from zero
    section Install and verify
      bun add -g webular: 5: User
      webular doctor: 4: User
      webular tasks: 3: User
    section Discover
      webular map a-site: 4: User
      webular search a-topic: 5: User
    section Gather
      webular scrape a-url: 5: User
      webular crawl a-site: 3: User
      webular extract with-schema: 4: User
    section Synthesize
      webular summarize: 5: User
      webular research a-topic: 5: User
    section Deliver
      write report via -o: 5: User
      webular monitor a-url: 4: User
